Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达正式量产并交付Vera CPU，专为Agentic AI工作负载打造</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI为ChatGPT Pro推出个人理财工具，支持直连超1.2万家银行账户</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor发布Composer 2.5编程大模型，性能对标GPT-5.5并大幅降低成本</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云发布通义千问Qwen3.7预览版，Max与Plus版本上线竞技场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/595447188a495841522150440d4d4c4f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云正式发布通义千问新一代旗舰模型Qwen3.7-Max-Preview与Qwen3.7-Plus-Preview，目前已上线大模型竞技场Arena AI及Qwen Chat。两款模型在预览阶段均仅支持“思考模式”，专注于高难度逻辑推理与深度计算，暂不支持网页搜索及代码解释器。性能表现方面，Qwen3.7-Max-Preview在文本处理领域位列全球第13，数学领域排名全球第7，并在专家级应用、软件与IT及编程能力榜单中跻身全球前十，助力通义千问实验室整体排名升至全球前六。此外，Qwen3.7-Plus-Preview在视觉领域排名全球第16，推动通义千问视觉榜单实验室排名跃升至全球第5。在专家竞技场赛道，Max版本位居全球第9。上述模型预计将在即将召开的阿里云峰会上正式向公众发布，标志着阿里云在多模态与深度</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联手黑石投资250亿美元组建AI云算力公司挑战英伟达</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6142afe7edca818d7c31ba3a72dc38db.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌与私募股权巨头黑石（Blackstone）达成合作，计划共同组建一家全新的人工智能云算力公司，整体投资规模达250亿美元。其中，黑石将先行注入50亿美元股权资本，其余资金通过金融杠杆筹集。该新公司核心战略是依托谷歌自研TPU（张量处理器）芯片及云基础设施，直接挑战CoreWeave等独立算力服务商，此举标志着谷歌TPU正式大规模向外部市场开放，并将加剧谷歌与英伟达在AI芯片领域的正面竞争。双方计划在2027年上线高达500兆瓦（MW）的算力容量，目前已提前锁定并启动相关数据中心建设。黑石作为全球最大的数据中心提供方之一，将通过此举进一步巩固其在AI物理基础设施领域的统治地位。该合作不仅提升了谷歌云的算力供给能力，也为行业提供了除英伟达生态之外的替代性算力选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达正式量产并交付Vera CPU，专为Agentic AI工作负载打造</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/68a5d3e23d10100cc7d1a0d2944878ca.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达近日宣布首款专为Agentic AI设计的定制CPU——Vera正式进入量产阶段，并已向Anthropic、OpenAI、SpaceXAI及甲骨文等顶尖公司交付首批系统。Vera CPU搭载88个自研奥林巴斯核心，内存带宽达1.2TB/s，性能较前代Grace CPU提升50%，旨在支持大规模智能体AI工作负载并保持强劲单核性能。SpaceXAI计划利用该处理器优化强化学习与智能体仿真管道，甲骨文则计划自2026年起部署数十万颗Vera CPU以提升推理效率。英伟达副总裁伊恩・巴克表示，Vera CPU不仅作为独立产品，未来还将与Rubin GPU集成，构建高效计算架构。该处理器的量产标志着英伟达在Agentic AI基础设施布局上的重大进展，将为下一代企业级AI应用提供核心算力支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI为ChatGPT Pro推出个人理财工具，支持直连超1.2万家银行账户</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日面向ChatGPT Pro订阅用户推出个人理财工具预览版，允许美国用户通过Plaid服务将个人银行账户与ChatGPT直接绑定。该功能支持接入包括第一资本、大通银行、美国运通及嘉信理财在内的超过1.2万家主流金融机构。连接后，用户可获取包含投资组合表现、开销比例、订阅服务及账单提醒的数据仪表盘。OpenAI表示，得益于GPT-5.5模型在上下文逻辑推理能力的提升，AI能基于真实财务数据提供个性化分析，如消费习惯诊断及长期储蓄规划。在隐私保护方面，用户拥有完全自主权，可随时断开账户连接并清除财务记忆。此举旨在将AI的深度推理能力直接应用于个人资产管理场景，为每月超2亿咨询理财问题的用户提供更具象的财务建议。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor发布Composer 2.5编程大模型，性能对标GPT-5.5并大幅降低成本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d706bd5e31e29dbb664027255fa597fb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor正式发布自研编程大模型Composer 2.5，该模型基于月之暗面Kimi K2.5基座微调，通过增加25倍合成任务数据及85%的强化学习计算预算，实现性能飞跃。在SWE-Bench和CursorBench v3.1评测中，Composer 2.5分别取得79.8%和63.2%的成绩，性能平齐Anthropic Opus 4.7与OpenAI GPT-5.5。在成本控制上，Composer 2.5每百万输入/输出代币价格仅为0.50美元和2.50美元，远低于行业主流收费标准。此外，Cursor还推出了一款高频变体版本，定价分别为3.00美元和15.00美元。目前，Composer 2.5已全面接入Cursor编辑器。Cursor正联合SpaceX与xAI，利用Colossus-2集群的百万级H100</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
